    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Chronicle</label><div><h5>Overview</h5><ul><li>Start page with seek, favorites, to-do, notes, skies, town tidings.</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: unseal command palette</li><li>1-9: unseal first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>/ : focus seek (also via palette)</li><li>Set down in seek: start seek</li><li>ESC: seal modals</li><li>Palette: quick actions for panels, livery, backdrop, data, favorites</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Restore header colors\" resets seek & clock</li></ul><h5>Seek & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Bangs: !g !ddg !bing !yt !wiki !maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in ledger settings; {q} as placeholder</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Set down starts seek</li></ul><h5>Tiles</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to unseal</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>Restore: restore common favorites</li></ul><h5>Panels & Layout</h5><ul><li>Visibility per panel</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Custom colors for clock/seek; restore restores style defaults</li><li>Panel colors & \"Tint panels\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>Backdrop</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/livery/interval)</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active backdrop</li></ul><h5>Data</h5><ul><li>Send Forth/Bring Forth as JSON</li><li>Fetch data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Steward</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in ledger settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change panels and ledger settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
      "agentLabel": "Startpage Steward (agentLabel)",
      "agentEnabled": "Steward enabled",
      "agentHint": "If disabled, nothing is sent to Ollama. aye."
    }
